        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We hired Camille to create and integrate a sales page on our website, and we are more than satisfied with the result. Her understanding of our needs, her professionalism, and the quality of her work far exceeded our expectations.\n\nCamille delivered a flawless project, on time and with great attention to detail. Thank you for your excellent service and highly professional support; it's a real pleasure to collaborate with you!\n\nAudrey Turgeon\nFounder of Conscious Finance",
        "time": 1766003089,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
