        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I've been working with Camille for over three years now, and she provides impeccable service. She's very organized and always meets her deadlines. From a creative standpoint, she understood my needs and personality perfectly, allowing her to develop a design and visual identity that truly reflects who I am. She's also very approachable, solution-oriented, and genuinely wants the best for her clients. I'm more than satisfied with the final result. It's a pleasure working with Camille, and I highly recommend her! 👌🙌",
